BE IT ENACTED BY THE LEGISLATURE OF THE STATE OF MINNESOTA:

Section 1.
Minnesota Statutes 2024, section 624.712, is amended by adding a subdivision to read:

Subd. 22.

Medical cannabis.

"Medical cannabis" has the meaning given in section 152.22, subdivision 6.

Sec. 2.
Minnesota Statutes 2024, section 624.712, is amended by adding a subdivision to read:

Subd. 23.

Qualifying patient.

"Qualifying patient" has the meaning given to the term "patient" in section 152.22, subdivision 9.

Sec. 3.
